                        <h2 class="mt-3 fw-bold">About</h2>
                        <hr style="border:1px solid black; margin-bottom:5px; margin-top:-5px;" />
                        <p class="m-0 text-justify text-dark mt-2" style="font-size:16px; line-height:28px;">
                            The department of electrical engineering at Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College Pratapgarh is committed to provide strong theoretical foundations alongside practical skills in both core and emerging areas of electrical engineering. The department offers comprehensive education in electrical machines, power systems, power electronics, control systems, electrical measurements, renewable energy systems, smart grid technologies, and electrical drives.
                            Emphasizing outcome-based education and experiential learning, the department enables students to analyse, design, and implement electrical systems that meet industry and societal requirements. Hands-on laboratory sessions and simulation-based activities translate theoretical knowledge into practical competence, while interdisciplinary exposure in areas such as renewable energy technologies, electric vehicles, energy management systems, power quality, automation, and digital substations prepares students to tackle contemporary challenges in the power and energy sector.
                            The department also instills professional ethics, safety standards, sustainability awareness, and a strong sense of responsibility toward national infrastructure development, shaping engineers who are technically competent, socially responsible and industry-ready.
                        </p>

                        <h2 class="mt-3 fw-bold">Vision</h2>
                        <hr style="border:1px solid black; margin-bottom:5px; margin-top:-5px;" />
                        <p class="m-0 text-justify text-dark mt-2" style="font-size:16px; line-height:28px;">
                            To be a centre of excellence in electrical engineering education by fostering academic excellence, innovation, and research, and by producing competent, ethical, and industry-ready professionals who contribute effectively to technological advancement, sustainable development and the betterment of society.
                        </p>

                        <h2 class="mt-3 fw-bold">Mission</h2>
                        <hr style="border:1px solid black; margin-bottom:5px; margin-top:-5px;" />
                        <ul class="welfare-font">
                            <li>To deliver high-quality education with a strong foundation in electrical engineering principles and practices.</li>
                            <li>To develop analytical, design, and problem-solving skills through effective teaching, laboratories, and industry interaction.</li>
                            <li>To promote research, innovation, and the adoption of emerging technologies in the field of electrical engineering.</li>
                            <li>To inculcate professional ethics, leadership qualities, and a commitment to lifelong learning.</li>
                        </ul>

